{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"padding_top":28,"padding_bottom":56}},"slideshow_h89GQy":{"type":"slideshow","blocks":{"slide_C7qw3h":{"type":"slide","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/webshop_aquamarine3.jpg","heading":"Aquamarine Gemstones","heading_size":"h2","subheading":"Discover the beauty of Aquamarines","button_label":"","link":"","button_style_secondary":false,"box_align":"middle-center","show_text_box":false,"text_alignment":"center","image_overlay_opacity":50,"color_scheme":"accent-1","text_alignment_mobile":"center"}}},"block_order":["slide_C7qw3h"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":[".slideshow__text.banner__box.content-container.content-container--full-width-mobile.color-accent-1.gradient.slideshow__text--center.slideshow__text-mobile--center {background: transparent !important;}"],"settings":{"layout":"full_bleed","slide_height":"small","slider_visual":"counter","auto_rotate":false,"change_slides_speed":5,"image_behavior":"none","show_text_below":false,"accessibility_info":"Slideshow about our brand"}},"image_banner_rBJHVC":{"type":"image-banner","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/D211710.jpg","image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"medium","desktop_content_position":"middle-center","show_text_box":true,"desktop_content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"center","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"show_text_below":true}},"rich_text_deHPzt":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"caption_EnAW7h":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"Embrace the Warmth of","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"heading_KFqhzV":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Carnelian Gemstones","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_LHqTey":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Welcome to Shamballa Jewels, where the captivating beauty of carnelian gemstones comes alive in our exclusive jewelry collection. Known for their rich, warm hues ranging from deep reds to vibrant oranges, carnelians are cherished for their distinctive glow and timeless appeal. Discover our stunning selection of carnelian bracelets and necklaces, each piece meticulously crafted to enhance your style with a touch of fiery elegance.<\/p>"}},"button_tUzrTm":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Explore our carnelian jewelry now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/aquamarine","button_style_secondary":false,"button_label_2":"","button_link_2":"","button_style_secondary_2":false}}},"block_order":["caption_EnAW7h","heading_KFqhzV","text_LHqTey","button_tUzrTm"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"image_with_text_yMLj4y":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"caption_Mz7PWw":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"What is","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"heading_QdRqzw":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Carnelian","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_Ub8JaM":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Carnelian is a semi-precious gemstone belonging to the chalcedony family, celebrated for its bold, reddish-orange color. This beautiful stone is formed from silicon dioxide, with iron oxide impurities giving it its characteristic hue. Carnelian has been revered since ancient times for its rich color and is often associated with vitality, creativity, and confidence. Its translucent to opaque quality adds depth to its appearance, making it a stunning choice for jewelry.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["caption_Mz7PWw","heading_QdRqzw","text_Ub8JaM"],"custom_css":[".image-with-text__content.image-with-text__content--middle.image-with-text__content--desktop-left.image-with-text__content--mobile-left.image-with-text__content--adapt.content-container.gradient.color-background-1 {background-image: none !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SS23_modelimageswebshop_female_1200x1200px5.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_BjPjVh":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"caption_9mLyHP":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"why choose","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"heading_PUrVyE":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"carnelian jewelry","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_CP3wyY":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>At Shamballa Jewels, our carnelian jewelry collection celebrates the vivid warmth of orange carnelian. Each of our bracelets is crafted with carefully selected orange carnelian beads, known for their rich, fiery hues that range from bright tangerine to deep sunset orange. These bracelets add a striking burst of color to any outfit, making them perfect for both everyday wear and special occasions. The natural durability of orange carnelian ensures that our bracelets are not only beautiful but also resilient, offering a timeless accessory that can be cherished for years to come.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["caption_9mLyHP","heading_PUrVyE","text_CP3wyY"],"custom_css":[".image-with-text__content.image-with-text__content--middle.image-with-text__content--desktop-left.image-with-text__content--mobile-left.image-with-text__content--adapt.content-container.gradient.color-background-1 {background-image: none !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/still_life_webshop5.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_ftzwzA":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"caption_fLkAtq":{"type":"caption","settings":{"caption":"how is","text_style":"caption-with-letter-spacing","text_size":"medium"}},"heading_jJmqX8":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"carnelian formed","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_BebBLq":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Carnelian is formed through the slow crystallization of silica-rich minerals within the Earth's crust, often in volcanic rock formations. Its warm, reddish-orange color is created by the presence of iron oxides within the stone. Carnelian deposits are found in various parts of the world, including Brazil, India, Madagascar, and the United States, and each piece is carefully sourced to ensure the highest quality.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["caption_fLkAtq","heading_jJmqX8","text_BebBLq"],"custom_css":[".image-with-text__content.image-with-text__content--middle.image-with-text__content--desktop-left.image-with-text__content--mobile-left.image-with-text__content--adapt.content-container.gradient.color-background-1 {background-image: none !important; background-color: #ffffff !important;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/still_life_webshop2_266f3281-859f-403a-b1b9-5a89884af5fb.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"featured_collection_kzJCPj":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"Discover our carnelian collection","heading_size":"h2","description":"<p>At Shamballa Jewels, our collection of orange carnelian bracelets is designed to highlight the captivating beauty of this vibrant gemstone. Each bracelet is meticulously crafted using the finest orange carnelian beads, selected for their intense, fiery hues. From minimalist designs that let the rich color of the carnelian shine to more elaborate styles that mix orange carnelian with other complementary elements, our bracelets are perfect for adding a warm, lively touch to any ensemble. Explore our range to find a bracelet that reflects your unique style.<\/p>","show_description":false,"description_style":"body","collection":"carnelian","products_to_show":4,"columns_desktop":4,"full_width":false,"show_view_all":false,"view_all_style":"outline","enable_desktop_slider":false,"color_scheme":"","image_ratio":"adapt","image_shape":"default","show_secondary_image":false,"show_vendor":false,"show_rating":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":8}},"rich_text_WE9kWX":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"button_aB678C":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Discover all carnelian jewelry","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/moonstone","button_style_secondary":false,"button_label_2":"","button_link_2":"","button_style_secondary_2":false}}},"block_order":["button_aB678C"],"settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"","full_width":true,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":52}}},"order":["main","slideshow_h89GQy","image_banner_rBJHVC","rich_text_deHPzt","image_with_text_yMLj4y","image_with_text_BjPjVh","image_with_text_ftzwzA","featured_collection_kzJCPj","rich_text_WE9kWX"]}